{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WRONG HOUSE \u2013 Multiplayer First-Person Survival Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899600/extras/c711512dd7c8fdfad7f9dfa35f48e771.poster.avif?t=1760032569\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899600/extras/c711512dd7c8fdfad7f9dfa35f48e771.webm?t=1760032569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899600/extras/c711512dd7c8fdfad7f9dfa35f48e771.mp4?t=1760032569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You thought it would be an easy score\u2014break into an abandoned mansion, grab some loot, and get out. But this is no ordinary break-in. This haunted house has a dark past\u2026 and something inside has been waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>WRONG HOUSE</strong>, a terrifying <strong>first-person survival horror game</strong>, you take on the role of a daring thief searching for valuable treasures inside a sprawling, <strong>abandoned and haunted mansion</strong>. The corridors are pitch-black, the air is heavy, and every creak of the floorboards could be your last. Multiple <strong>ghosts and monsters</strong> roam the estate, each with unique behaviors and hunting styles, forcing you to adapt if you want to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899600/extras/2eb22d3e8fd49c3d339363a639aeccc1.poster.avif?t=1760032569\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899600/extras/2eb22d3e8fd49c3d339363a639aeccc1.webm?t=1760032569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899600/extras/2eb22d3e8fd49c3d339363a639aeccc1.mp4?t=1760032569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Survival Horror:</strong> Immersive gameplay set in a creepy, abandoned mansion filled with supernatural threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer &amp; Multiplayer Co-Op:</strong> Face the horror alone or with friends in <strong>online co-op multiplayer</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Loot &amp; Encounters:</strong> Valuable items spawn in different locations each run, creating endless replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899600/extras/643417d7eb4c5498ae9bfc55d55a99cb.poster.avif?t=1760032569\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899600/extras/643417d7eb4c5498ae9bfc55d55a99cb.webm?t=1760032569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899600/extras/643417d7eb4c5498ae9bfc55d55a99cb.mp4?t=1760032569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Supernatural Enemies:</strong> Each ghost or monster hunts you in its own unique way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Permadeath:</strong> One wrong move and it\u2019s over \u2014 the game restarts, loot reshuffles, and the nightmare begins again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror Experience:</strong> Dark rooms, tense sound design, and unpredictable dangers keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899600/extras/4eb01b69f239a5279e7b87bd52ab0218.poster.avif?t=1760032569\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899600/extras/4eb01b69f239a5279e7b87bd52ab0218.webm?t=1760032569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899600/extras/4eb01b69f239a5279e7b87bd52ab0218.mp4?t=1760032569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mansion won\u2019t give up its treasures without a fight. Will you escape with the loot\u2026 or join the countless souls lost within its walls?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899600?t=1760032569","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899600?t=1760032569","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899600/a1223afd72c224d997936e45100b8526c4e3be3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760032569","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899600/a1223afd72c224d997936e45100b8526c4e3be3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760032569","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WR